{"sections":[{"type":"Meta","title":"Which skills are employers seeking in your area?","description":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts ","contentTitle":"Title for google analytics","releaseDate":"2023-01-01","lastUpdated":"2023-01-01","outputSeries":"slugforoutputseries","contentType":"robo-journalism"},{"type":"Twisty","title":"These are \"statistics in development\". Learn more here.","content":"<p>This article presents “official statistics in development”. This means they are subject to revision, and may change in the future following user feedback.</p><p>Further information is included in the <a href=\"https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/employmentandemployeetypes/methodologies/measuringlabourdemandvolumesacrosstheukusingtextkerneldatauserguide\">accompanying user guide.</a></p>"},{"type":"Header","title":"Job adverts on the Isle of Anglesey","label":"Select a UK local authority to explore local trends in online job adverts. All London local authorities are combined. "},{"type":"Summary","title":"On the Isle of Anglesey:","sections":[{"indicator":"Job adverts","value":"1.3","note":"","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts on the Isle of Anglesey was below the UK average. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#job_adverts\">More about job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Skills","value":"72%","note":"","content":"<p>In West Wales and The Valleys, a higher proportion of adverts in 2023 could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#skills\">More about skills</a>  &darr;</span></p>"},{"indicator":"Health","value":"75%","note":"","content":"<p>A higher proportion of health and social care job adverts in West Wales and The Valleys could have been filled by local people. </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#health\">More about health and social care job adverts</a>  &darr;</span></p>"}]},{"id":"job_adverts","type":"Section","title":"In August 2024, there were fewer online job adverts than the UK average on the Isle of Anglesey","content":"<p>In August 2024, the number of live job adverts on the Isle of Anglesey remained around 1.3 per 100 working-age residents (aged 16 to 64 years). </p><p>This was lower than the UK average of 3.4 adverts per 100 working-age residents in August 2024. </p>"},{"id":"linechart","type":"Chart","chartType":"line","title":"Trends in job adverts","subtitle":"Trends in job adverts per 100 working-age residents on the Isle of Anglesey, June 2017 to August 2024","footer":"Source: Textkernel, Office for National Statistics","data":[{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2017-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.873952149},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2017-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.162381838},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2017-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.177797029},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2017-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.009631309},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2017-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.596223915},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2017-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.527428848},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2017-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.442836395},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.630117707},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.594293756},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-03-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.647389969},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-03-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.868474923},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-04-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":1.020342886},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-05-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.727993859},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-06-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.713920164},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-07-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.539918117},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-08-31T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.548618219},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-09-30T23:00:00.000Z","y":0.53863869},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"2018-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","y":0.492579324},{"z":"Isle of Anglesey","x":"